1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,970
We are receiving reports
of massive devastation in Los Angeles,

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:08,280
where some sort of explosive device
was detonated just moments ago.

3
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:11,210
The destruction is centered
on the city's busy port,

4
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:14,360
but the damage extends
for miles in all directions.

5
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:19,630
Early speculation indicates that the blast
may have been nuclear in nature,

6
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:24,320
and authorities are estimating
a death toll in the hundreds of thousands.

7
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,830
"We thought it was an earthquake,"
said one witness,

8
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,880
"but then we looked out toward the water
and saw the cloud."

9
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,980
I wish it was an earthquake.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:35,190
We will continue to bring you
all the breaking news

11
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,580
on this tragic series of events.
